[5828]={["name"]="Humar the Pridelord",["texts"]={["enUS"]="A black lion near Ratchet, surrounded by his pride and prized by hunters for his distinctive coat.",["frFR"]="Un lion noir près de Cabestan, entouré de sa troupe et recherché par les chasseurs pour son pelage singulier.",["esES"]="Un león negro cerca de Trinquete, rodeado por su manada y codiciado por los cazadores por su pelaje distintivo.",["ruRU"]="Чёрный лев близ Кабестана, окружённый своим прайдом. Охотники ценят его необычный окрас.",["deDE"]="Ein schwarzer Löwe nahe Ratschet, umgeben von seinem Rudel und von Jägern wegen seines besonderen Fells begehrt."},["sources"]={{"Wowhead: Humar the Pridelord","https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=5828"},{"Warcraft Wiki: Humar the Pridelord","https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Humar_the_Pridelord"}},["scope"]="lore"},
